@startuml 系统结构图
title 个人云盘系统结构图（MVP）

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

actor "用户" as User

rectangle "个人云盘系统" {

  package "表现层" {
    [Web 前端] as Web
    [Windows 应用程序] as WinApp
  }

  package "应用层" {
    [认证模块\n- 注册\n- 登录] as Auth
    [文件管理模块\n- 文件列表\n- 新建文件夹\n- 重命名] as FileMgmt
    [上传模块\n- 10GB 校验\n- 分片上传\n- 进度展示] as Upload
    [回收站模块\n- 删除\n- 恢复\n- 彻底删除] as Recycle
    [容量统计模块\n- 总容量\n- 已使用\n- 剩余容量\n- 使用百分比] as Capacity
  }

  package "领域与基础设施层" {
    [用户服务] as UserService
    [文件元数据服务] as MetaService
    [存储服务] as StorageService
    [磁盘监控服务] as DiskService

    database "用户数据" as UserDB
    database "文件元数据" as MetaDB
    folder "服务器文件存储" as FileStorage
    collections "回收站存储区" as TrashStorage
  }
}

User --> Web
User --> WinApp

Web --> Auth
Web --> FileMgmt
Web --> Upload
Web --> Recycle
Web --> Capacity

WinApp --> Auth
WinApp --> FileMgmt
WinApp --> Upload
WinApp --> Recycle
WinApp --> Capacity

Auth --> UserService
FileMgmt --> MetaService
Upload --> StorageService
Upload --> MetaService
Upload --> Capacity
Recycle --> MetaService
Recycle --> StorageService
Capacity --> DiskService

UserService --> UserDB
MetaService --> MetaDB
StorageService --> FileStorage
Recycle --> TrashStorage
DiskService --> FileStorage

note right of Capacity
仅统计单服务器磁盘容量，
不包含用户套餐、多服务器、
对象存储容量聚合。
end note

note bottom of Upload
前端与后端都必须校验单文件 <= 10GB；
大文件上传支持分片与进度反馈。
end note

note bottom of Recycle
删除采用“先入回收站”，
支持恢复与彻底删除。
end note

@enduml
